# LUT Studios taste (reference)

Source: https://lutstudios.com/ · full notes: `lutstudios.com.md`

## Do
- Treat the site as a **set**: fixed 100vh shell, scene changes via **looping plates**, not a long marketing scroll
- UI chrome = sparse white labels (Outfit + **wide tracking** ~0.28em on nav) over cinematic media
- Prefer **diegetic content** (UI inside the world) when the plate can carry it
- Gate with a serious loader — assets are the product

## Don’t
- Don’t confuse this with Terminal scrub (`progress → currentTime` on one film) — LUT is **room cuts**
- Don’t add card grids / purple CTAs / stat strips on top of a heavy plate
- Don’t use narrow default tracking on all-caps nav over bright footage

## Tokens (approx)
- Void: `#0A0A0A`
- UI: `#FFFFFF` Outfit 700 · 18px · letter-spacing ~5px (nav)
- Hint: 12px · `*swipe to discover`
- Media: multi MP4 loops ~5s; pager dots
